{"lines":[{"y":0.098837209158732731,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"Sample Writing answers","w":0.21604937235514324,"x":0.13168724778590576,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.13168724012825223,"y":0.14098837196812042,"w":0.29423868815104165,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","c":1},{"y":0.1743227327155753,"w":0.70987655639648439,"t":"This is a thoughtful exploration of the topic. The writer considers the advantages","x":0.17489711263900895,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"h":0.016012340046912987,"c":1,"t":"of having online materials rather than printed ones, and also examines why","x":0.17489711112148237,"y":0.19040697659679107,"w":0.66460906982421886},{"x":0.17476348796177887,"t":"printed books may not totally disappear, although other printed materials, such as","y":0.20532829462531232,"w":0.72042419433593752,"h":0.020257010757572136,"c":1},{"x":0.17481998511599442,"y":0.22302745884649067,"t":"magazines and newspapers, may become completely digitalised. The score might","w":0.72856928507486984,"h":0.019109743924809353,"c":1},{"x":0.17489713979831767,"h":0.016195524146054074,"c":1,"y":0.2396937572409028,"w":0.72839502970377612,"t":"be improved by further exploration of whether online materials will be free, as cost"},{"x":0.1728394976681191,"t":"is mentioned only briefly. Organisation is clear, paragraphing is logical and linking","w":0.72222223917643225,"h":0.015995219964161089,"y":0.25726744171258087,"c":1},{"x":0.1748224501310589,"c":1,"h":0.017874677273915451,"t":"words and phrases guide the reader through the script [All of these factors |","w":0.67092656453450517,"y":0.2733795903900238},{"w":0.70781890869140629,"c":1,"t":"On the other hand | Based on this]. The range of vocabulary is quite varied, with","x":0.17695474314937656,"y":0.29063604264713394,"h":0.016195524146054296},{"x":0.17483598970478179,"w":0.71823735555013013,"c":1,"t":"many examples of collocation [electronic devices | Digital book and newspapers |","y":0.3067898830213065,"h":0.0174566410